{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2025-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1759276800, "end_date": 1759881599, "month_true_total": 29, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:25:24 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "206135415", "author": {"steamid": "76561199078190815", "personaname": "Pseudo64", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199078190815/", "num_games_owned": 112, "num_reviews": 141, "playtime_forever": 112, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 83, "last_played": 1767346333, "avatar": "a988758debc448d866c721dc72236080a3a66949"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just got to the ending, or at least one of the endings, and took me 66 minutes and around 6-8 drones with a lots and lots of power ups to achieve that lol. In the beginning the game is slow and stuff, but as you go on and on, gathering powerups and killing and dodging and everything, by the ending it just becomes pure chaos and pure power fantasy. Especially the boss fight with [spoiler] providence [/spoiler] was epic. \n\nI don't know if I should keep playing this game to get other endings or with any other classes and all, but even with the little time I got with it, and the fun I had by the end of my first run where I reached an ending, will always stay with me, and who knows, maybe if I decide to return to play this more in the future when I am craving that high again. Haha.\n\n\nEdit: I don't know why it is showing three diffrent timings for me on steam. The library says 4.3 hours, the review edit says 3 hours, and when I publish the review it says 1.4 hours. Dunno what's broken lol,", "timestamp_created": 1759861610, "timestamp_updated": 1759861696, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false